1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:02,518
This is my ticket to Star Wars.

2
00:00:02,524 --> 00:00:05,054
(Sheldon:)I don't have to tell you
it is worth far more

3
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:08,690
(Sheldon:)than its face value
of $15.50.

4
00:00:08,696 --> 00:00:11,436
(Sheldon:)I trust you'll give it
to someone worthy.

5
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:12,733
(Leonard:)You got it.

6
00:00:12,734 --> 00:00:14,334
(Leonard:)Well, Penny might
want to join us.

7
00:00:14,335 --> 00:00:17,775
(Sheldon:)This is my ticket
to Star Wars.

8
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,140
(knocking)
SHELDON: Penny.

9
00:00:20,141 --> 00:00:21,311
Penny?
(knocking)

10
00:00:21,309 --> 00:00:22,439
(knocking)
Penny?

11
00:00:22,444 --> 00:00:24,814
(Bernadette:)What happens if
I say, “Come in”?

12
00:00:24,813 --> 00:00:26,483
(Penny:)Well, find out.

13
00:00:26,481 --> 00:00:27,811
Come in!

14
00:00:31,119 --> 00:00:33,089
(knocking)
Bernadette?

15
00:00:33,088 --> 00:00:35,088
(knocking) Bernadette?
Bernadette?

16
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:37,360
Come in!

17
00:00:37,358 --> 00:00:39,388
SHELDON:
Keep it up.

18
00:00:39,394 --> 00:00:41,424
(Sheldon:)I got nowhere else to be.

19
00:00:41,429 --> 00:00:43,399
(Bernadette:)Just come in.

20
00:00:44,532 --> 00:00:47,132
(Sheldon:)For future reference,
if I want to watch Mean Girls,

21
00:00:47,135 --> 00:00:49,605
(Sheldon:)I'll stream it on Netflix.

22
00:00:49,604 --> 00:00:51,734
(Penny:)We're sorry.
What do you need?

23
00:00:51,739 --> 00:00:53,109
(Sheldon:)Well, as you know,

24
00:00:53,108 --> 00:00:55,108
(Sheldon:)I'll be celebrating
Amy's birthday with her,

25
00:00:55,110 --> 00:00:56,340
(Sheldon:)and I could use your assistance

26
00:00:56,344 --> 00:00:58,214
(Sheldon:)in helping me select
the perfect gift.

27
00:00:58,213 --> 00:00:59,743
(Raj:)Sure.
Well, so far,

